{"c":[{"name":"20260825T202720Z-e2156bfaebf2808e","text":"PR #55 review: zoom pack map keyed by node.name so a shared content id prints the first list_view row; _index_tree inside loads_tree try so unprojectable children skip like other unreadable packs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T202837Z-054930bcd901bdc3","text":"Root catalog treats any git-visible path under /.summem/ as a started store, not only config.toml; file-level ignore of config.toml cannot hide a store that has notes.","type":"note"}]}
